/**
 * DRAFT — B2B Product Detail Layout for VS02 PRO / V-TH1 Top-Mounted Parking AC
 *
 * Layout intent:
 *  - Two-column desktop: LEFT scrolls (gallery + specs + factory video + certs + install/application photos + exhibition trust + reviews)
 *  - RIGHT is sticky (always visible): inquiry form + WhatsApp + email/phone + key facts
 *  - NO prices anywhere
 *  - Mobile: stacks (form moved to top as anchor + repeated at bottom)
 *
 * Route: /drafts/top-mounted-b2b (DEV only)
 */
